# Chapter 1 — Before Fight 1 (Kael vs. Rhex)

@music main_theme
@card DAY 4 OF DARKNESS | The Abandoned Training Ground
@bg training_ground

@page
@panel strip | kael, rhex | Wide cinematic shot of the dark abandoned training courtyard: Kael on the left and Rhex on the right standing far apart facing each other, a dropped lantern glowing on the flagstones between them
> We return to the training ground. Kael and Rhex stand facing each other.
@show left kael
@show right rhex
@panel wide | rhex | Rhex spreading his arms with a mocking grin, gesturing at the ruined courtyard around them
RHEX [smile]: Funny, isn't it? After all this time, we're standing in the same place where we used to train.
@panel wide | kael | Kael with a pained, steady expression, lantern light on his face
KAEL: Except we used to fight without trying to kill each other.
RHEX: Those were weaker days.

@page
@panel square | kael | Close-up of Kael, a sad quiet look, remembering
KAEL [sad]: We were happy.
@panel square | rhex | Close-up of Rhex's face turning cold and serious, red eyes hard
RHEX [determined]: You were happy. I was waiting for something better.
@panel splash | rhex | Dramatic low-angle shot of Rhex lifting a huge battle axe as roaring black flames with ember-red cores spread across its blade, lighting the darkness, embers swirling around him
> Rhex lifts his axe. Black flames spread across its blade.
@fx FWASH | flame_wave

@page
@panel wide | kael, rhex | Kael stepping back in shock, shielding his eyes from the black flames burning on Rhex's axe
KAEL [shocked]: Where did you get that power?
RHEX: From someone who understands what strength is worth.
@panel wide | kael, rhex | Medium two-shot, the two old friends arguing across the black firelight
KAEL: Auren gave you everything you needed to become a great fighter.
RHEX: Auren taught us to hold back.
@panel action | kael | Kael drawing his slightly curved sword in one smooth motion, a thin light-blue lightning edge crackling along the blade, speed lines
> Kael draws his sword.
@fx SHHING | swing_light
KAEL: He taught us when not to fight.

@page
@panel action | rhex | Rhex roaring with fury, black flames flaring higher behind him, axe raised
RHEX [angry]: Then he taught you how to die.
@panel square | kael | Extreme close-up of Kael's determined light-blue eyes and his clean, unmarked face, lightning glinting in his eyes
KAEL [determined]: I'm not leaving without an answer. Where is the Centroid?
@panel strip | kael, rhex | Both fighters in battle stances facing off across the courtyard, lightning sword versus black-flame axe, dust rising, the moment before the clash
RHEX [smile]: Beat me, and perhaps I'll tell you.
@title FIGHT 01 | Kael vs. Rhex
@next fight fight01
